  "validation_plan": "On the next iteration, check that per-candidate objective standard deviations become > 0 (parameter_spread and distance_from_center std > 0) and that performance distribution changes from the constant value 0.0155. If no change occurs, follow-up action should target implementation (scorer outputs) or further diagnostic interventions.",
